{
  "name": "moa",
  "description": "Giant moa (Dinornis), standing, facing right: huge flightless bird with no visible wings, long thick neck held forward-up, small head with a short broad bill, shaggy hair-like brown #7a5a3a feathers with darker streaks hanging in a ragged fringe, very thick scaly grey legs with three big clawed toes. Not cute (small hard eye under a brow). Bottom-centre anchor (feet on y=0), ~560x900: true size at scale 1 next to Doug at scale 1 (3.6 m bird).",
